---
// Problem.astro — "One app, five departments" pitch paragraph.
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="title">One app, five departments</h2>
    <p class="body">
      Whether you're filling attendant posts across multiple sessions, assigning
      audio operators to mixers, figuring out who's running cameras,
      coordinating stage assignments, or organizing parking coverage — the work
      behind an assembly doesn't stop when the program starts. AssemblyOps gives
      every department the tools to schedule volunteers, track attendance, and
      stay coordinated — all from one app.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    padding: var(--section-pad-y) 0;
  }
  .container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 16px;
  }
  .title {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .body {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .title {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
